# An id that is a keyword must stay quoted when displayed: `[<id> AS …]` only
# accepts an identifier token, so a bare keyword id fails to reparse
# (SQL-769). This is a fuzzer-only requirement. Real catalog IDs have a prefix
# followed by digits and cannot collide with keywords.
